### Page 1 of 1

```text
RESOLUTION NO. _________
ENTITLED: “A RESOLUTION AUTHORIZING THE MAYOR AND CITY CLERK OF
THE CITY OF CHEYENNE TO ENTER INTO AN AGREEMENT TO
PURCHASE 537 SQUARE FEET OF LAND LOCATED AT THE
SOUTHEAST CORNER OF THE INTERSECTION OF EAST 19TH
STREET AND CONVERSE AVENUE CHEYENNE, LARAMIE COUNTY,
WYOMING,”
WHEREAS, the City of Cheyenne desires to acquire 537 square feet of land located at the
southeast corner of the intersection of East 19 Street and Converse Avenue, Cheyenne, Wyoming;
th
and

WHEREAS, the Cole Corporation, a Wyoming corporation, is the owner of the land which
the City wishes to acquire; and
WHEREAS the City and the Cole Corporation have entered into negotiations for the
purchase and sale of the said 537 square feet of land and have agreed to the terms and conditions of
the sale as set forth in the proposed agreement which is attached hereto as Exhibit A and
incorporated herein by reference.
NOW, THEREFORE, BE IT RESOLVED BY THE GOVERNING BODY OF THE CITY
OF CHEYENNE, WYOMING, that the Mayor and the City Clerk are hereby authorized to execute
the purchase agreement which is attached hereto as Exhibit A and to take such other and further
actions and to execute such other and further documents as shall be necessary to complete the
acquisition of the said 537 square feet of land.
PRESENTED, READ AND ADOPTED THIS ______ DAY OF ______________, 2012.
__________________________________________
Richard L. Kaysen, Mayor
(SEAL)
Attest:
____________________________________
Carol Intlekofer, City Clerk
```
